  "prefLabel": "Odb 203.18 Advance Filing of Exhibits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 203.18 Advance Filing of Exhibits. Any party intending to use exhibits shall file an original and 20 copies thereof with the board at least 15 days prior to the hearing at which such exhibits are to be introduced.\n\nSource. #8490-A, eff 11-22-05; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
